      "events": [
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "portrait",
          "code": 20,
          "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 20,
          "async": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "layout.set",
          "value": {
            "avg": true,
            "position": "down",
            "offset": 0,
            "align": "left",
            "bold": true,
            "background": "winskin.png",
            "title": [
              255,
              225,
              80,
              1
            ],
            "text": [
              255,
              255,
              255,
              1
            ],
            "titlefont": 22,
            "textfont": 16,
            "lineHeight": 22,
            "time": 10,
            "letterSpacing": 0,
            "animateTime": 120
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "（雖然好像是被勒索了，但至少應該能學到一點東西吧？）",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "那個……藍師傅？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "唉呀～梗平你來啦！為師正想找你來著",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "來打三人麻將，學學中國古拳法",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "這兩者之間有什麼關係啊？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "此言差矣，窮其道者，歸處亦同",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "什麼時候突擊，什麼時候該保守",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "這不正是武術的攻守之道嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "我覺得這還是有點差距的",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "唉唷～來嘛！三人麻將速度夠快，花不了你多少時間的！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "要不然這樣好了，打贏我就教你真功夫！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "合著你一開始就沒想教啊！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "呃…怎麼可能，總之，打吧…哈哈…",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_smile.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "唉，行吧，閒著也是閒著，來打吧",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "就是這樣嘛！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "lanxiang_mahjong_cg.png",
          "sloc": [
            0,
            0,
            416,
            286
          ],
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（第一局）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "胡！斷么九",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "唉唷～梗平，你也太沒夢想了吧～",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（第二局）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "胡！小三元",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "呃…沒事，只是運氣好而已，繼續！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（第三局）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "胡！國士無雙！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "啊！！！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_angry.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 0,
          "async": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（一段時間後）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "來啦！這邊五萬！今天贏的全被你搶了！靠！梗平，你怎麼不說你很會打！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "欸！你又沒問！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（此時，沉默打著麻將的第三人開口了）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "第三人",
          "text": "1994年，在東南亞打自由搏擊，奪得冠軍"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "第三人",
          "text": "2000年，打贏了日本重砲手雷龍，接著連續3年打敗所有日本空手道高手，贏得全日本自由搏擊冠軍"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "第三人",
          "text": "自此，中國古拳法被稱為空手道剋星。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "！！！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_angry.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "第三人",
          "text": "但是，在2008年的中日大賽，惜敗給阿蘇山斷水流，真是可惜啊！"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "你是……",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "第三人",
          "text": "斷水流傳人"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "有何貴幹？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "沒事，只是看看昔日傳奇的醜樣而已",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "……看完了就滾吧！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_angry.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "連中國古拳法最強者都這麼孬了",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "我看中國古拳法不行了吧",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "……那只是我技不如人，中國古拳法可沒輸",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "你可以看出來吧！那邊的梗平並未習過武",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "只需幾日訓練，便能脫胎換骨，打倒你",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "噢是噢，我好怕噢",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "時間規則我訂，地點你選，行嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "好，雖然雙方都換人，但就讓我們把2008年的勝負打完吧！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（斷水流傳人離開了）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "慢著！有問過我的意願嗎！",
