          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "抱歉讓你捲入這事，我會找時間和你解釋的",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_sad.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "今天就先這樣吧？好嗎",
