            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "他從剛才一直都在，只是你沒發覺到",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "藍師傅絕對不是好武術家，是不是好人有待商榷，但他絕對是一位好母親",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "他為了兒子可以拋棄尊嚴，和你這個為了尊嚴而無視人性的武術家不同",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
