            "image": "keng_angry_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（但是被梗平躲開了，梗平拉近雙方距離，然後……）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "陰陽勾魂鎖！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "是鎖技嗎！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（斷水流傳人被梗平狠狠的鎖定）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "老實說吧，我不可能在幾天之內成為高手",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_panic_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "但是藍師傅發現了一個重要的弱點",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "就是你的耳朵！耳朵不是餃子耳！你沒在學關節技",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "確實！但我們的體格差距太大了，這種鎖馬上就能……解不開！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "沒用的，陰陽勾魂鎖是藍師傅在2008年以後才創的究極奧義",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "而且為了練出這招",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "我可是被要求對一台疾速行駛的大卡車鎖住，盪來盪去一整天啊！！！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_angry_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "哈哈（苦笑）",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_smile.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "烏喔喔喔！！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_angry_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "要窒息了！我投降！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（一段時間後）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "中國古拳法名不虛傳，受教了",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "你的打擊技其實超越了你師傅和我，梗平能躲是因為我是拿衝鋒槍對他練的",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "我差點就死了好不好！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "你只是忽略關節技的訓練，以及你自大的心態",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "收心，然後……記得別成為像我或你師傅一樣的人",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "銘記在心，作為這次挑釁的賠償，我會嘗試說服我師傅，讓你重返武術界",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "其實回不回都無所謂了",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（藍湘看向梗平）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "已經有超越我們的下一代了……",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "當然，能的話還是很好，那就有勞了！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "斷水流傳人",
          "text": "好，那我先回去了",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_duanshuiliu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（斷水流傳人走了）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "梗平",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "怎麼了？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（藍湘對梗平深深的鞠躬）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "謝謝你，此等恩情藍某終身難忘",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_smile.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "小小謝禮，不成敬意",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（藍湘拿給梗平一個鼓鼓的信封）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "這是？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "裡面是十五萬，以及我的聯絡方法，以後若是有難，在下赴湯蹈火，在所不辭",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "……那我就收下了，那藍師傅，你之後要做什麼？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "可能去幫我兒子掃墓，或是去找個工作",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "總之，就是去正經活著吧？既然你都能打贏高手了，這個也沒什麼大不了的",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "是嗎…那…有緣再見？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "lanxiang_goodbye_cg.png",
          "sloc": [
            0,
            0,
            416,
            286
          ],
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "藍湘",
          "text": "嗯！有緣再見！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "lanxiang_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 0,
          "async": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（就這樣，梗平得到了武藝和十五萬，而藍湘得到了面對這個世界的動力，可喜可賀）"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（至於梗平之後遇上了大麻煩，聯絡了藍湘，來個不下於本作的混沌冒險，又是另外一回事了）"
        },
